            "max_width_desktop": "",
            "quote": "“As a business, as a hotel, at the end of the day, we sell sleep. One of the reasons we chose Blueair is not only because it’s one of the best products, but it also has a very silent operating system that allowed our guests to breathe clean air and sleep very peacefully.”",
